Derived from antoniocosta/unifi-openwrt and its contributors:
https://github.com/antoniocosta/unifi-openwrt
Starting upstream revision: a211831.

This fork adds the KeeneticOS/Entware backend, ukn daemon, guarded WLAN
provisioning and recovery, and an OrbStack test environment. The upstream
protocol implementation, OpenWrt backend and model catalogue are retained.
Original authors' rights and third-party notices are unchanged. The Go
module path remains the upstream path for internal import compatibility;
it does not identify this fork as an upstream release.

Keenetic is a trademark of its owner. This fork is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or supported by Keenetic, Ubiquiti or the OpenWrt project.

